    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-02">Scope: the filtered `query` endpoint returns a communication list filtered by thread/regarding/channel/date — all reusing the read path; `participant=` resolves against the junction (FR-08) but is STUBBED here (inert/graceful) and wired in task 051; access filter applied; unknown/empty filters degrade gracefully; returns the R1 DTO shape.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-03">Scope: every facet MUST apply R1's impersonation + 2-rule (privacy + internal-only) filter via `IImpersonatedCommunicationQuery` + `CommunicationAccessFilter`; no message content bypasses the BFF filter. MUST NOT reintroduce membership-union on reads (retired 2026-07-16). No second/divergent filter; no text-LIKE participant fallback.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Scope: reuse the blessed impersonation read path (`CommunicationThreadReadService` / `IImpersonatedCommunicationQuery`); MUST NOT fork it or `new` a credential; inject central `TokenCredential` + canonical Dataverse interfaces.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-008">Scope: the new route carries the standard communication authorization endpoint filter; auth posture consistent with the existing `/api/communications` group.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-019">Scope: bad filters (malformed date, unknown channel, bad regarding `entityType`, `participant=` not-yet-supported) return RFC 7807 ProblemDetails; no unhandled 500; graceful degradation.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">Scope: the `regarding=` facet uses the existing 11-entity family via `RegardingFieldMap.All`; MUST NOT add a second regarding mechanism.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-032 / ADR-010">Scope: the route is registered unconditionally on the existing group; any feature-gated dependency uses the Null-Object pattern (no asymmetric registration); interfaces are test seams over concretes.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project §10">Scope: BFF Hygiene — load `.claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md` before designing; state the Placement Justification in the PR (extends the existing group + read service — no new group/mechanism); report publish-size delta vs ~46.99 MB baseline (expected ≈0); no new HIGH CVE; update tests in `tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/`.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project §11">Scope: Component Justification — the route is new only because REST needs a new path; state the concrete FR-02/NFR-03 failure modes prevented (grid/widget cannot filter across records; 051 has no route to complete; leak on any facet) with grep evidence that no existing route offers a cross-record filtered query.</constraint>
  </constraints>

